      ro: ["Art\u0103 din 12.000 \u00ee.Hr. p\u00e2n\u0103 \u00een 100 d.Hr.", "Arat\u0103 girafe \u0219i elefan\u021bi.", "Patrimoniu Mondial UNESCO."],
