      ro: ["S\u0103pate ad\u00e2nc \u00een st\u00e2nc\u0103.", "Ofer\u0103 izola\u021bie natural\u0103.", "Unele sunt \u00eenc\u0103 locuite ast\u0103zi."],
      en: ["Dug deep into the rock.", "Provides natural insulation.", "Some are still inhabited today."]
