      ro: ["Folosit la \u00eenceputul secolului al XVI-lea.", "Pierdut \u00een fa\u021ba otomanilor \u00een 1551.", "Parte a complexului Castelului Ro\u0219u."],
      en: ["Used in the early 16th century.", "Lost to the Ottomans in 1551.", "Part of the Red Castle complexes."]
