      ro: ["Fort\u0103rea\u021b\u0103 strategic\u0103 de coast\u0103.", "Adesea disputat\u0103 \u00een istorie.", "\u00cen mare parte reconstruit\u0103 modern."],
      en: ["Strategic coastal fortress.", "Often contested in history.", "Largely overbuilt by modern structures."]
